[x] Define typed update complete and cancel operations =action-transaction-types $Deserialize the published tagged operation shapes, normalize canonical IDs, and apply them in order to an in-memory trusted workspace model without adding plans, charters, move, delete, generic JSON Patch, or snapshot revisions.$ !1 %2026-08-15T19:43 #019fdffc-b1b0-7681-9dc2-6a57ae571db7
